# Generated caches and build artifacts. Keeps top-level agent scans, listings,
# and git status free of noise/bloat. The Godot project has its own supplementary
# rules in projects/first-steps/.gitignore (do not duplicate there).
**/.godot/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Godot export/build artifacts (if produced at any depth)
export/
*.pck
*.zip
